|---|---|
| **Full-width** | `width: 100%` on the banner, placed at the top of your page |
| **Dismissable** | Close button via `sc-icon-button` with `action-circle-close` icon |
| **Accessible** | `role="banner"`, `aria-live="polite"`, `aria-label` on close button |
| **Theming** | Uses Scale design tokens (`--sc-color-primary`, `--sc-spacing-*`, `--sc-typography-body-short`) |
| **Event** | Fires `sc-dismiss` custom event when closed, so parent components can react |

