```html
<style>
  .applied-filters {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .applied-filters__label {
    font: var(--telekom-text-style-body);
    color: var(--telekom-color-text-and-icon-standard);
    margin-right: 4px;
  }

  .applied-filters__clear-all {
    margin-left: 8px;
  }
</style>

<div class="applied-filters" id="active-filters">
  <span class="applied-filters__label">Filters:</span>

  <sc-tag dismissable size="small" id="filter-category">
    Category: Electronics
  </sc-tag>

  <sc-tag dismissable size="small" id="filter-price">
    Price: $50 – $200
  </sc-tag>

  <sc-tag dismissable size="small" id="filter-brand">
    Brand: Samsung
  </sc-tag>

  <sc-tag dismissable size="small" id="filter-rating">
    Rating: 4★ & up
  </sc-tag>

  <sc-button variant="secondary" size="small" class="applied-filters__clear-all" id="clear-all">
    Clear all
  </sc-button>
</div>

<script>
  // Remove individual filter on dismiss
  document.querySelectorAll('sc-tag[dismissable]').forEach((tag) => {
    tag.addEventListener('scale-close', (e) => {
      const filterId = e.target.id;
      e.target.remove();

      // Emit a custom event so the rest of the app can react
      document.dispatchEvent(
        new CustomEvent('filter-removed', { detail: { filterId } })
      );

      // Hide the bar entirely when no filters remain
      const remaining = document.querySelectorAll('#active-filters sc-tag');
      if (remaining.length === 0) {
        document.getElementById('active-filters').hidden = true;
      }
    });
  });

  // Clear all filters at once
  document.getElementById('clear-all').addEventListener('click', () => {
    document.querySelectorAll('#active-filters sc-tag').forEach((tag) => tag.remove());
    document.getElementById('active-filters').hidden = true;

    document.dispatchEvent(
      new CustomEvent('filter-removed', { detail: { filterId: 'all' } })
    );
  });
</script>
```

### How it works

| Piece | Role |
|---|---|
| **`sc-tag dismissable`** | Renders each active filter as a small tag with a built-in **✕** close icon. |
| **`scale-close` event** | Fired by `sc-tag` when the user clicks the dismiss icon — we remove the DOM node and dispatch a `filter-removed` custom event so the rest of the page can update results. |
| **`sc-button` "Clear all"** | Removes every remaining filter tag at once and hides the bar. |
| **Auto-hide** | When the last individual filter is dismissed, the entire filter bar hides itself. |

Each `sc-tag` gets a unique `id` (e.g. `filter-category`, `filter-price`) so your application logic can map the dismissal back to the corresponding filter state.

